{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIyL091dCUyME9mJTIwRGFya25lc3MlMjAlMjgyMDIyJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Out Of Darkness","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/owwNYUxjRwJdhjxCl6asIt0v9uV.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t90KM83WYtsAt8S4zdorFV7w5qV.jpg","description":"This Danish movie \"Out of The Darkness\"  ( in Danish 'De Forbandede år 2' )  is a continuation of the popular WW II drama \"Into The Darkness\"  ( in Danish 'De forbandede år' )  and it portraits the Danish Resistance movements fight.  This movie takes place after 1943 where the official politic of 'corporation' comes to an end, and the Danish Resistance movement is gaining traction.  The movie follows the Skov family from 1943 to the end of WWII. The growing opposition to the occupation and the increased brutality of the Germans have fatal consequences for the family.","releaseInfo":"2022","genres":["Drama","War","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.9","runtime":"154 min","cast":["Jesper Christensen","Bodil Jørgensen","Mads Reuther","Gustav Dyekjær Giese","Sara Viktoria","Lue Støvelbæk","Sylvester Byder","Pernille Højmark"],"director":["Anders Refn"],"released":"2022-04-21T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Jesper Christensen","character":"Karl Skov","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/w7ekkX2nzBKZQEp0JVTh8WdGs5U.jpg"},{"name":"Bodil Jørgensen","character":"Eva Skov","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kRkN87GCdgQGFOhsPltP4rAiqJq.jpg"},{"name":"Mads Reuther","character":"Aksel Skov","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nAb2G7N1kup1iHUOJZwHkVM8vq7.jpg"},{"name":"Gustav Dyekjær Giese","character":"Michael Skov","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vYZteb9JuoxlXFMlhSTro3dNNne.jpg"},{"name":"Sara Viktoria","character":"Helene Skov","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iC3uQbVS0EcaYtQVUPUZM7tFrFj.jpg"},{"name":"Lue Støvelbæk","character":"Knud Skov","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4wX1ZSl4BHlrc4Xbu